        "synthesis": "Four members explicitly prefer the Feldmann-Maini TNF-blockade configuration, sharing its clear mechanistic-to-clinical narrative, durable therapeutic impact, and compact attribution. They also agree that the boundary around prior TNF research and subsequent therapeutic development requires historical scrutiny."
      },
      {
        "ballot_ids": [
          "B014"
        ],
        "explicit_supporters": [
          "linnarsson-sten",
          "sandberg-rickard"
